                                "text": "Fuso also had a thing when holding things – at times they just fell off and broke, the reason why he prefered^([sic]) using china and glasses at the table and he never held newborn babies.[…]Fuso didn't consider himselft^([sic]) clumsy though, heavyhanded was a more acceptable word."
