                                "sense_id": "0a4fa006-8b1b-3baa-acf6-5c0fa23f71af",
                                "text": "Jordan Bartel of the Chicago Tribune named the chapter a timeless and saw a feasible Emmy recommendation for Vincent Kartheiser, however sensed the kitchenette sink allegorism and finishing voiceover was a itty-bitty heavyhanded."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
