                                "sense_id": "2064d19d-00ba-34f1-aa74-d9c323994551",
                                "text": "The heavyhanded loyalty oath and affidavit requirements of the NDEA fellowships have received a great deal of publicity, but the real coercive effect of NDEA on graduate education has little to do with such know-nothing excrescences."
